---
/**
 * The news page and the home page are the same page. This route only exists so
 * that /news/<slug> has a parent that resolves, and so any link already
 * pointing at /news lands somewhere sensible.
 *
 * A temporary redirect rather than a permanent one: browsers cache a 308 hard
 * enough that undoing this later would strand anyone who had visited.
 */
return Astro.redirect(`/${Astro.url.search}`, 302);
---
